# Publish Blog Article — Bahor-Voyage CMS

## Trigger
User says: "publish article", "new blog post", "post this article", "add to blog", or pastes article text with a request to publish.

## Steps

### 1. Collect missing input
Ask for: title, body text, focus keyword, cover image URL. Optional: excerpt, secondary keywords, publish date.

### 2. Write `scripts/article-draft.json`

```json
{
  "title": "Article title here",
  "slug": "article-slug-here",
  "excerpt": "150-220 char summary with focus keyword.",
  "publishedAt": "2025-05-25T08:00:00.000Z",
  "isFeatured": false,
  "focusKeyword": "main seo keyword",
  "secondaryKeywords": ["keyword 2", "keyword 3"],
  "seoTitle": "SEO title 50-60 chars",
  "metaDescription": "Meta description 140-160 chars with keyword and CTA.",
  "ogTitle": "OG title",
  "ogDescription": "OG description",
  "twitterTitle": "Twitter title",
  "twitterDescription": "Twitter description",
  "coverImageUrl": "https://...",
  "coverImageAlt": "Descriptive alt text",
  "authorId": "author-bahor-voyage",
  "categoryIds": ["category-guide-voyage"],
  "tags": ["tag1", "tag2"],
  "relatedTours": [
    { "label": "Circuit name", "href": "/circuits/slug" }
  ],
  "body": "## H2 Heading\n\nParagraph with **bold** and [link](/circuits).\n\n- Bullet\n\n![Alt](https://img-url.jpg)"
}
```

### 3. Run publisher
```bash
npm run blog:publish
```

### 4. Confirm success
Output: `✅ Published! → Article : http://localhost:3000/blog/{slug}`

---

## Body Markdown Reference

The `body` string is auto-converted to Sanity Portable Text by the publisher script.

| Syntax | Result |
|---|---|
| `## Heading` | H2 block |
| `### Heading` | H3 block |
| `- item` | Bullet list item |
| `**text**` | Bold |
| `*text*` | Italic |
| `[text](url)` | Link annotation |
| `![alt](url)` | Inline image (auto-uploaded to Sanity CDN) |
| `> text` | Blockquote |

## SEO Rules

- Focus keyword in title, first paragraph, 2+ H2s
- `seoTitle` 50-60 chars; `metaDescription` 140-160 chars with CTA
- 3+ internal links to `/circuits/*`, 1+ to `/contact`

## Internal Links

- `/circuits`, `/circuits/samarcande-boukhara`, `/circuits/grand-circuit-18j`
- `/circuits/immersion-totale-14j`, `/circuits/voyage-solidaire-11j`
- `/contact`

## Slug Rule

Lowercase → remove accents → spaces to hyphens → max 60 chars
Example: "Visiter Boukhara 2025" → `visiter-boukhara-2025`
